r←testConfigFlags;req;r;count;st;name;desc;i;limit
⎕CS ##
⍝ Isolated runtime test for config flag metadata APIs.

:If 0=⎕NC'null'
    init 'lib/'
:EndIf

req←{0::⍺,' - FAILED: ',⎕DMX.Message ⋄ ⍵:⍺,' - OK' ⋄ ⍺,' - FAILED'}
r←⊂'Test Config Flag Metadata API'

count←configCount
r,←⊂'config_count is positive' req 0<count
r,←⊂'getConfigFlag wrapper exists' req 3=⎕NC'getConfigFlag'
r,←⊂'duckdb_get_config_flag binding exists' req 3=api.⎕NC'duckdb_get_config_flag'

:If 0<count
    (st name desc)←getConfigFlag 0
    r,←⊂'get_config_flag(0) status success' req DuckDBSuccess=st
    r,←⊂'get_config_flag(0) name non-empty' req 0<≢name
    r,←⊂'get_config_flag(0) description non-empty' req 0<≢desc

    limit←3⌊count
    :For i :In ⍳limit
        (st name desc)←getConfigFlag i
        r,←⊂('get_config_flag(',⍕i,') status success') req DuckDBSuccess=st
        r,←⊂('get_config_flag(',⍕i,') name non-empty') req 0<≢name
    :EndFor
:EndIf

⍝ Out-of-range is blocked by wrapper guard (no C call).
(st name desc)←getConfigFlag count
r,←⊂'get_config_flag(out-of-range) guarded error' req (DuckDBError=st)∧(0=≢name)∧0=≢desc

r,←⊂''
r,←⊂'Config flag metadata testing complete!'
⎕←↑r

⍝ KSL 1.0.0
